WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Kannazuki no Miko

00:00.980 --> 00:04.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:15.390 --> 00:17.620
Welcome to my church...

00:18.060 --> 00:21.620
Lunar Priestess, Himemiya Chikane-san.

00:27.960 --> 00:28.960
You're...

00:29.340 --> 00:32.410
Orochi's Second Neck, Sister Miyako.

00:34.310 --> 00:37.720
I'm here to redeem you.

00:40.190 --> 00:43.310
That was the day of the great judgment.

00:43.990 --> 00:46.190
Our rough yet kind days were over.

00:46.790 --> 00:50.160
The new story of Chikane-chan's
and my destiny...

00:50.630 --> 00:53.630
quietly raised its curtains.

01:21.890 --> 01:25.955
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

01:25.956 --> 01:30.019
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

01:30.020 --> 01:33.085
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:33.086 --> 01:36.149
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:36.150 --> 01:38.280
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:38.910 --> 01:40.680
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:40.681 --> 01:42.449
Surely my existence is here now

01:42.450 --> 01:44.160
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:44.163 --> 01:45.495
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:45.496 --> 01:46.829
There's no more tears to cry

01:46.830 --> 01:48.955
tada dakiaeru shunkan

01:48.956 --> 01:51.080
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

01:51.540 --> 01:53.690
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

01:53.691 --> 01:55.840
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

01:56.050 --> 01:58.490
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

01:58.491 --> 02:00.929
Flowing towards the other side of time,

02:00.930 --> 02:03.265
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

02:03.266 --> 02:05.600
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

02:05.890 --> 02:08.080
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

02:08.081 --> 02:10.269
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

02:10.270 --> 02:14.565
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

02:14.566 --> 02:18.860
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

02:36.370 --> 02:37.569
Oh man.

02:37.570 --> 02:39.899
The forecast said it wouldn't rain.

02:39.900 --> 02:42.139
We need shelter somewhere.

02:42.140 --> 02:44.010
Oogami-kun, how about over there?

02:48.280 --> 02:49.890
To redeem me?

02:50.180 --> 02:54.030
Now, confess everything in front of God.

02:54.490 --> 02:58.150
Tell the truth and make a confession.

02:58.170 --> 03:00.910
Don't fool around with me, Orochi.

03:04.360 --> 03:07.629
Your heart is a stormy sea.

03:07.630 --> 03:12.960
It's raging and crying out,
seeking what it truly desires.

03:39.160 --> 03:41.740
What you truly desire is...

03:47.370 --> 03:52.500
your little bird who stays
beside you and chirps by your ear.

03:53.310 --> 03:56.110
The cute little bird you love.

03:56.960 --> 03:59.465
Seventh Episode

03:57.850 --> 04:00.350
Kurusugawa Himeko.

03:59.466 --> 04:01.930
Rainfall in the Hell of Love

04:07.970 --> 04:09.970
- Closed. Thanks for your support.
- Closed. Thanks for your support.

04:14.630 --> 04:18.730
Wow, it's dirtier than I thought.

04:19.220 --> 04:20.780
It can't be helped.

04:23.160 --> 04:24.820
Sorry, Kurusugawa.

04:25.010 --> 04:26.539
Why?

04:26.540 --> 04:28.780
You didn't do anything wrong.

04:30.420 --> 04:33.750
You should dry off. Catching
a cold would be bad.

04:34.950 --> 04:37.700
Oh, but...

04:39.390 --> 04:41.980
It's fine. I won't look. If I do, I'll die.

04:42.330 --> 04:43.840
I'll commit suicide!

04:45.100 --> 04:46.090
Okay.

04:46.091 --> 04:48.290
I don't know what you're talking about.

04:49.320 --> 04:50.640
Really?

04:50.910 --> 04:54.409
I'm the Lunar Priestess. I'll
protect the Solar Priestess...

04:54.410 --> 04:55.900
and battle Orochi with her.

04:56.400 --> 04:59.480
I wonder what will happen after the battle.

05:04.050 --> 05:07.260
Who's the one protecting
the little bird now?

05:07.590 --> 05:09.950
Who's looking straight at her?

05:10.420 --> 05:13.330
Who's trying to embrace her now?

05:15.890 --> 05:18.959
Even if you defeat Orochi
and save the world...

05:18.960 --> 05:22.210
the storm within you will not calm down.

05:24.720 --> 05:28.739
When the battle's done, and your
duty as a priestess is fulfilled...

05:28.740 --> 05:32.579
your bond with the little
bird will be broken off.

05:32.580 --> 05:35.940
You'll no longer have a
special relationship.

05:43.350 --> 05:45.819
I'll let you know when I'm done.

05:45.820 --> 05:46.820
Okay.

06:10.800 --> 06:12.180
Oogami-kun?

06:13.450 --> 06:16.280
What does that have to do with me?

06:17.490 --> 06:18.490
I...

06:21.630 --> 06:24.599
Your cute, cute little bird...

06:24.600 --> 06:29.240
flew away into the free skies
where your hands cannot reach.

06:34.740 --> 06:35.970
Don't...

06:36.470 --> 06:37.710
Don't touch me!

06:38.100 --> 06:39.080
That's right.

06:39.081 --> 06:42.649
The one allowed to touch you,
the one you want to touch...

06:42.650 --> 06:45.049
is that little bird alone.

06:45.050 --> 06:46.170
I'm sorry.

06:49.630 --> 06:52.489
Whispering those loving
words in her ears...

06:52.490 --> 06:55.229
Feeling each other's warmth...

06:55.230 --> 06:58.199
Sharing kisses as sweet as honey...

06:58.200 --> 06:59.600
And...

07:00.260 --> 07:01.260
You're wrong.

07:01.530 --> 07:02.100
You're wrong.

07:02.420 --> 07:03.420
You're wrong!

07:06.540 --> 07:10.520
I don't desire such a thing!

07:11.780 --> 07:14.139
A romance that cannot be blessed.

07:14.140 --> 07:15.869
A love of sure regret.

07:15.870 --> 07:18.349
A feeling that will never come true.

07:18.350 --> 07:21.670
Even though you know that, you still...

07:21.970 --> 07:23.170
You're wrong!

07:25.190 --> 07:27.459
What's wrong, Oogami-kun?

07:27.460 --> 07:29.030
Uh, nothing.

07:30.400 --> 07:32.990
Did something happen before?

07:34.030 --> 07:35.230
Nothing.

07:36.670 --> 07:37.670
Oogami-kun?

07:38.540 --> 07:39.540
Sorry.

07:40.530 --> 07:42.129
Stupid... I'm stupid.

07:42.130 --> 07:44.400
So commit suicide. I mean apologize first.

07:45.060 --> 07:47.079
Is it my fault?

07:47.080 --> 07:50.200
But I have no idea what I did wrong.

07:50.980 --> 07:51.980
Um...

07:56.020 --> 07:57.020
I...

07:57.260 --> 08:01.859
I just want to protect her
smile, her happiness.

08:01.860 --> 08:03.260
That by itself...

08:03.810 --> 08:05.200
What I want...

08:11.720 --> 08:13.590
You want happiness for the two of you.

08:15.970 --> 08:20.980
But that's impossible
because you're a girl.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.980
I keep apologizing, don't I?

08:28.580 --> 08:31.610
When you made the time to go out with me.

08:32.060 --> 08:33.259
I...

08:33.260 --> 08:35.490
Not at all, Oogami-kun.

08:37.010 --> 08:39.240
What am I doing?

08:42.190 --> 08:43.230
Sorry.

08:44.080 --> 08:45.240
I didn't mean to scare you.

08:47.950 --> 08:49.250
Kurusugawa...

08:49.780 --> 08:52.309
The hand that fought for me.

08:52.310 --> 08:55.349
The hand that gave me the hairpin.

08:55.350 --> 08:59.470
Your hand, which always supports timid me.

09:02.470 --> 09:05.650
It's sad if you abuse it.

09:36.250 --> 09:38.059
The wet look's the best.

09:38.060 --> 09:40.760
I love seeing through to the bra.

09:43.270 --> 09:45.480
Let's have a date today.

09:45.770 --> 09:47.929
Get out of here, Seventh Neck!

09:47.930 --> 09:50.020
She's my Hime-chan!

09:50.940 --> 09:52.730
Don't worry. We'll be done soon.

09:53.230 --> 09:55.400
Go to hell, you bastard!

10:19.000 --> 10:20.220
Oogami-kun!

10:30.740 --> 10:31.940
Damn it...

10:40.140 --> 10:43.369
Not bad... Now I'll get serious!

10:43.370 --> 10:44.700
You're useless.

10:50.510 --> 10:51.650
Damn...

11:12.750 --> 11:14.480
Get lost already, stupid.

11:14.780 --> 11:17.480
Yeah, the fun begins now.

11:18.560 --> 11:19.990
Launch the attack.

11:32.940 --> 11:38.140
Don't worry. What you need
to do is very simple.

11:38.800 --> 11:42.510
Just end it before someone else does...

11:42.880 --> 11:44.640
with your own hands.

11:46.690 --> 11:49.449
Though you two can't see the future...

11:49.450 --> 11:53.650
you can hold on to each
other and die gracefully.

11:55.070 --> 11:57.900
That's your true desire.

12:02.020 --> 12:04.740
Tear it apart already.

12:06.270 --> 12:08.340
The world is a chain.

12:08.840 --> 12:11.599
One not trying to know your love's depth...

12:11.600 --> 12:16.190
a hateful, chiding chain,
selfishly binding you.

12:19.220 --> 12:20.220
Ready.

12:20.221 --> 12:22.220
Damn it, you guys!

12:31.960 --> 12:32.930
Yes!

12:32.930 --> 12:33.860
No.

12:33.860 --> 12:34.860
Huh?

12:42.270 --> 12:44.709
Oogami-kun, this is...

12:44.710 --> 12:46.160
Don't worry.

12:48.080 --> 12:50.379
There's one I've already beaten.

12:50.380 --> 12:54.670
Sorry, but Orochi won't die that easily.

12:56.020 --> 12:58.170
Meow-Meow won't lose this time.

13:00.920 --> 13:03.419
Till we destroy man's world.

13:03.420 --> 13:07.230
Then I'll defeat you as
many times as I can!

13:19.950 --> 13:21.710
Now, confess.

13:22.510 --> 13:24.700
God forgives all.

13:24.950 --> 13:29.580
I'm sure he'll also listen
to your forbidden desires.

13:36.570 --> 13:40.339
Don't make me laugh. This isn't Himeko.

13:40.340 --> 13:41.590
Not my Himeko!

13:41.780 --> 13:42.780
Oogami-kun!

13:49.620 --> 13:50.620
What?

13:57.720 --> 13:58.850
I...

13:59.160 --> 14:01.860
I don't wish for my desires to be met.

14:02.860 --> 14:03.860
I...

14:21.330 --> 14:23.250
Don't hurt Meow-Meow!

14:23.390 --> 14:24.760
Don't be cocky!

14:26.510 --> 14:27.680
Take this!

14:28.930 --> 14:30.470
He's pissing me off!

14:34.720 --> 14:35.850
Got him.

14:42.440 --> 14:43.529
Meow!

14:43.530 --> 14:44.759
Hey, you're heavy!

14:44.760 --> 14:46.149
Hey, you're heavy! Shut up, 69th!

14:46.150 --> 14:47.750
I'm 68th!

14:48.900 --> 14:50.890
The power's overflowing.

14:51.250 --> 14:54.740
Yet there's no unease or pain
in Orochi's power pulling me.

14:55.100 --> 14:56.510
What is this?

14:56.940 --> 14:58.540
Oogami-kun...

15:09.950 --> 15:11.240
Saint Just.

15:13.590 --> 15:15.010
Easy, easy.

15:15.460 --> 15:18.000
I have to go.

15:18.900 --> 15:22.020
I have to go to where Himeko is.

15:24.590 --> 15:26.020
Himeko...

15:26.500 --> 15:28.030
I want to talk with you.

15:28.860 --> 15:31.420
About the birthday... About the hairpin...

15:33.110 --> 15:35.549
No, any topic is fine.

15:35.550 --> 15:37.120
I just want...

15:37.540 --> 15:39.540
to talk with you, Himeko.

15:41.060 --> 15:46.420
Sparkling Solar Wave of
Ultimate Destruction!

15:47.390 --> 15:49.550
Crap... Retreat!

15:53.630 --> 15:56.100
I told you not to worry.

16:06.180 --> 16:07.570
Himeko...

16:08.750 --> 16:11.200
Wow...

16:11.220 --> 16:13.180
This is amazing!

16:13.700 --> 16:18.559
It's as if I'm in a sea of stars. This
is the first time I've seen this.

16:18.560 --> 16:20.200
Hey, Kurusugawa.

16:20.570 --> 16:27.029
Sad and painful things don't go
away easily like the rain...

16:27.030 --> 16:30.099
but when you look at
the sky after the rain...

16:30.100 --> 16:32.740
you can see the
beautiful stars perfectly.

16:33.100 --> 16:36.309
If you hang in there,
there'll be days like this.

16:36.310 --> 16:38.140
That might be a little different.

16:39.370 --> 16:43.140
It's not that I couldn't see them.
It's that you showed them to me.

16:44.950 --> 16:47.350
I'm sure I won't forget.

16:47.920 --> 16:53.180
Even five or ten years later, I'm
sure I'll remember this sight.

16:53.760 --> 16:57.899
And my heart will be filled
with warmth when I think of it.

16:57.900 --> 16:58.910
That's how I feel.

16:59.710 --> 17:01.219
Thank you, Souma-kun.

17:01.220 --> 17:06.380
Please, it's no big deal. I'll show
it to you any time you want, Himeko.

17:07.920 --> 17:08.989
W-What?

17:08.990 --> 17:10.369
You just said Himeko.

17:10.370 --> 17:11.839
Did I say that?

17:11.840 --> 17:12.680
You did.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.430
I didn't.

17:13.430 --> 17:14.430
You did!

17:19.690 --> 17:20.690
Seriously?

17:20.910 --> 17:22.270
What now, Aneki?

17:22.830 --> 17:24.730
We all got beaten.

17:25.500 --> 17:26.650
Beaten?

17:26.960 --> 17:28.610
You think so?

18:09.370 --> 18:11.690
I see. So that's it.

18:21.130 --> 18:22.130
Himeko?

18:25.380 --> 18:27.110
Kurusugawa?

18:28.590 --> 18:31.259
Sorry, I, um...

18:31.260 --> 18:33.859
I didn't think you'd hate it that much.

18:33.860 --> 18:35.959
I was just so...

18:35.960 --> 18:37.380
Anyway, I'm sorry.

18:37.730 --> 18:41.059
No, I didn't hate it. I didn't hate it.

18:41.060 --> 18:43.390
That's not it, but...

18:44.030 --> 18:47.210
I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Souma-kun.

18:54.300 --> 18:57.490
Ojousama? Kurusugawa-sama has returned.

18:58.900 --> 19:01.680
Welcome back, Kurusugawa-sama.

19:02.970 --> 19:05.620
Welcome back, Kurusugawa-san.

19:06.640 --> 19:08.390
Has something happened?

19:12.400 --> 19:14.790
Kurusugawa-san, I'm coming in.

19:21.540 --> 19:23.390
Did something happen, Himeko?

19:23.870 --> 19:25.040
Nothing.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.440
It's nothing.

19:28.090 --> 19:29.090
You're lying.

19:29.160 --> 19:33.110
With a face like that,
how could it be nothing?

19:33.280 --> 19:36.219
Right? Talk to me about anything.

19:36.220 --> 19:39.610
It'll make you feel better
than keeping it all in.

19:39.970 --> 19:41.580
Please, Himeko.

19:42.810 --> 19:44.200
Chikane-chan...

19:47.830 --> 19:50.130
You see, I...

19:52.990 --> 19:55.879
I see. Something like that happened.

19:55.880 --> 19:59.969
It's not like I hated
it or felt embarrassed.

19:59.970 --> 20:04.390
But I felt a pain in my chest,
and it began to hurt a lot.

20:04.700 --> 20:06.409
I wonder why.

20:06.410 --> 20:10.339
There were times I was scared,
but it was fun in the end.

20:10.340 --> 20:12.960
Why'd it turn out this way?

20:13.320 --> 20:15.900
It was my first kiss, too.

20:20.080 --> 20:22.829
But I thought of it this way, too.

20:22.830 --> 20:27.200
You once told me about the
shell matching game, right?

20:27.630 --> 20:31.960
How there's just one person
in the world waiting for me.

20:32.220 --> 20:34.959
Yes, I remember.

20:34.960 --> 20:40.960
I think that one special
person might be Souma.

20:41.740 --> 20:45.779
When I'm with Souma, my heart races...

20:45.780 --> 20:46.979
So fast...

20:46.980 --> 20:48.970
Your feelings won't reach her.

20:52.370 --> 20:53.769
Chikane-chan?

20:53.770 --> 20:56.059
I'm happy for you, Himeko.

20:56.060 --> 20:57.060
Thanks.

20:59.050 --> 21:00.770
I'm happy for you.

21:02.460 --> 21:05.300
Madam, there is a call for you.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.810
I see. All right.

21:10.020 --> 21:11.830
Chikane-chan, um...

21:12.270 --> 21:15.810
Sorry, I'll listen to the rest later.

21:16.270 --> 21:17.270
Okay.

21:17.950 --> 21:19.550
Good night, Himeko.

21:19.940 --> 21:21.320
Good night.

21:32.810 --> 21:35.270
I won't kill you yet.

21:35.840 --> 21:40.430
Because Tsubasa-sama's pain and suffering
is incomparable to yours.

21:41.130 --> 21:44.639
Until the final judgment,
the last battle...

21:44.640 --> 21:47.660
you shall crawl about
on the floor of hell.

21:48.070 --> 21:49.219
That's right.

21:49.220 --> 21:51.380
I won't kill you yet.

21:59.290 --> 22:01.570
I've decided.

22:06.800 --> 22:08.730
I've decided, Himeko.

22:10.050 --> 22:11.720
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.723 --> 22:13.720
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.723 --> 22:15.535
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.536 --> 22:17.349
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.350 --> 22:20.940
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:20.943 --> 22:22.460
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.461 --> 22:23.979
At least... yes, only now

22:23.980 --> 22:26.360
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.363 --> 22:28.360
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.363 --> 22:32.030
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.033 --> 22:33.620
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.623 --> 22:35.830
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.831 --> 22:38.039
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.040 --> 22:40.375
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.376 --> 22:42.709
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.710 --> 22:45.650
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.651 --> 22:48.589
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.590 --> 22:50.635
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.636 --> 22:52.680
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.510 --> 22:54.930
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:54.931 --> 22:56.349
Just by being by my side

22:56.350 --> 22:58.165
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.166 --> 22:59.979
Just by remaining in the same time as me

22:59.980 --> 23:03.440
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.441 --> 23:06.899
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.900 --> 23:08.880
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.881 --> 23:10.859
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.860 --> 23:12.675
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.676 --> 23:14.489
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.490 --> 23:16.305
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.306 --> 23:18.119
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.120 --> 23:23.645
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.646 --> 23:29.170
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:39.980 --> 23:41.900
Next Time

23:39.980 --> 23:41.900
- Next Time
- Next Time

23:42.570 --> 23:44.960
Always protecting me.

23:45.600 --> 23:47.800
Always there for me.

23:47.960 --> 23:51.499
A dear person who warmly
accepts my feelings...

23:51.500 --> 23:53.320
and supports me at all times.

23:54.210 --> 23:56.349
So I want to respond, too.

23:56.350 --> 23:58.310
For that person, I...

23:58.940 --> 24:05.960
Storm of the Silver Moon

23:59.420 --> 24:03.149
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 8.

24:03.150 --> 24:05.119
Storm of the Silver Moon.

24:05.120 --> 24:08.589
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
